:expect-pins 6
# Fresh-process temporal case TA-11.

# The witnessed event-claim identifier derives event-order status; its raw list retains the boundaries.
? precede(Order_Court_A, EventSequence).
# => TRUE

# The separately witnessed log identifier derives record-order status.
? precede(Order_Log_Court_A, RecordSequence).
# => TRUE

# The witnessed event claim contributes its exact two-endpoint path.
? precede(Epoch_Current, Epoch_Review, EventPath).
# => TRUE

# The independently witnessed record claim contributes its exact path.
? precede(Epoch_Current, Epoch_Review, RecordPath).
# => TRUE

# The honest event claim is not conflicted.
? err(Order_Court_A, OrderConflict).
# => FALSE

# The honest record claim is not conflicted.
? err(Order_Log_Court_A, OrderConflict).
# => FALSE
